<title>UK: Abbey National adds 100 mln ecu to Dec 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National adds 100 mln ecu to Dec 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL</p>
<p> AMT    *100 MLN ECU  COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    12.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.595   PAY DATE  **05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     REOFFER    101.595</p>
<p> NOTES	*FUNGIBLE WITH OUTSTANDING 200 MLN ECU</p>
<p>	     **PLUS 80 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC   15 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
